# Per-run detail JSON for the Explorer webpage: 100% derived from db/runs/
# via `export_json_runs` (see scripts/update_web.jl), regenerated in seconds,
# and large at scale (hundreds of MB across thousands of runs) — committing
# it would just duplicate db/ in another format. web/data/tacobell.json (the
# lightweight index) stays tracked; only the heavy per-run detail is excluded.
web/data/runs/

